[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬうっ……！\n錬金術とやらが、これほどとは……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grraaahhh...! To think alchemy could be this powerful...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまでです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……さぁ、ここからだよ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...Well now, here's where it gets interesting.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（この状況、レスナたちはコウセンに\n\u3000とどめを刺すしかない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(In this situation, Resna and the others have no choice but to finish Kosen off.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でもそれって結局、僕たちの「管理」とやってること\n\u3000が同じなんだ。危険分子を排除し、問題を解決する）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But that's exactly the same as what we do with our 'management.' Eliminate dangerous elements and solve problems.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そのことを諭してあげよう。\n\u3000レスナも僕たちの行動を理解してくれるはず）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I should point this out to her. Resna will finally understand what we've been doing.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "復讐を、考え直してください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please reconsider your path of revenge!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なんだと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "子を失ったあなたの気持ちが分かるなんて\nそんなこと、私には言えません。でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I could never claim to understand how it feels to lose a child. But..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢さんは反乱を起こす前ですし、\n他の皆さんも無事……まだやり直せます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya never went through with the rebellion, and everyone else is safe... You can still start over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、何を言っているんだい、君は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, what are you saying?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生まれる前の人造頂獣を助けた話は聞いてるよ。\nでも今回はそれとはまったく別の状況だろう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard about how you saved that artificial Apexi. But this is a demon we're talking about!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつの頭の中には、鏑矢への……人間への復讐。\nそれしかないんだよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All that's in this thing's head is revenge against Kaburaya... against humans. That's it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]